flowchart LR
  CALLER[Caller<br/>browser web call] --> VP
  subgraph VAPI[Vapi cloud: the voice pipeline]
    VP[STT Soniox → LLM GPT-4.1 → TTS Vapi voice<br/>turn-taking, interruptions, silence ladder]
    CFG[(Stored assistant:<br/>prompt, tools, limits)]
  end
  YAML[assistant/prompt.md + receptionist.yaml] -->|make sync-assistant-apply| CFG
